# generated voxel-model assets (regenerable via services/compute/app/build_*.py).
# Models are committed so GitHub Pages can serve them — EXCEPT the sub-mm ones, whose
# volumes exceed GitHub's 100 MB per-file limit and would be far too much to download
# over the web anyway. Only their .model.json is committed, so the subject still appears
# in the picker; rebuild the volume locally and run the GPU backend to use it.
#   hires_shoulder  254 MB    hand_hires  316 MB
services/compute/data/
apps/web/public/models/hires_shoulder/*.mat.bin
apps/web/public/models/hires_shoulder/*.glb
apps/web/public/models/hand_hires/*.mat.bin
